Maintainer: realni <ant@ict4.cz>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), build-essential, bc, bison, flex,
 libssl-dev, uuid-dev, device-tree-compiler, python3, python3-dev, python3-setuptools,
 python3-pyelftools, swig, libgnutls28-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: u-boot-gemini-simplefb
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: U-Boot for the Planet Gemini PDA (MediaTek MT6797)
 Built natively on aarch64 (no cross compiler) from the gemini-two-stage
 branch. One build yields two images: stage 1 (u-boot-gemini-boot.img), flashed
 once into the write-protected "boot" partition and carrying the early
 chainloader, and stage 2 (u-boot-gemini-stage2.img, chainload disabled) plus
 its sha256 digest, which stage 1 loads from /boot/u-boot/ on the "linux"
 partition so U-Boot can be updated by a plain file write. Also ships the raw
 u-boot.bin and the DTB under /usr/lib/u-boot-gemini/.
